Preserve numerical behavior of the original scanpy-scripts environment.

Vendor the validated SciPy 1.8.1 svds reconstruction and scoped Scanpy/sklearn
adapters. Retain column-major UMAP edge visitation without changing installed
SciPy classes, and omit the obsolete sklearn TSNE square_distances argument.
Upstream source versions and licenses are recorded in the added modules.

